  "causebase_summary": "Spiritualists National Union Of WA Inc is a Western Australian incorporated organisation that, according to its website, describes itself as \"a centre of like-minded people\" who gather to share life experiences, spiritual growth, wisdom and knowledge. The website states the group seeks to \"expand the knowledge that the soul does indeed live on\" and to demonstrate that people can \"communicate with loved ones who have passed.\" The site publishes a mediums schedule for upcoming services and mediums, and advertises a learning programme that includes spiritualism and mediumship training; it invites contact for more information or to learn where to find the church. An ACNC register extract is listed among the sources. The organisation’s ACNC Information Statement for 01/07/2022–30/06/2023 reports revenue of AUD 22,323 and total expenses of AUD 17,592 for that period. The available evidence is primarily the organisation’s website text and the ACNC AIS financial extract; no independent descriptions of day-to-day operations or external evaluations were provided in the supplied material.",
